# The BRAN and extreme-loss experiment, rCBF fold 0 (bran_ext_plan.md §5): the paper's own
# predictor in place of gan_bpm's generator, and Zeng's extreme loss in the predictor, in the
# diffusion loss, or in both. CV fold 0 is a development set (ctp_only_decisions.md #29);
# ISLES 2018 is not touched.
#
#   1. Pretrain the three BRANs (a few hours each, on an L40S box, not the H100):
#                                                             PRE_L1  PRE_EXT  PRE_LOW
#   2. Score them alone on fold 0's held-out cases (14958):   CHECK_PRE
#   3. Train MRDPM with them (about 20 h each, H100):          TRAIN_L1  TRAIN_EXT  TRAIN_EXT_DIFF  TRAIN_L1_DIFF
#   4. Sample fold 0's held-out cases (about 6 h each, H100):  TEST_*, and TEST_BASE: today's MRDPM
#      (gan_bpm's predictor), the control. If its fold-0 CV test exists already, delete every line
#      that names TEST_BASE: the core check refuses two complete tests of one run.
#   5. Score everything (14958):                              CHECK_ALL
#
# First, once each: the checks (bran_ext_plan.md §6: scripts/bran_ext_checks.py and
# scripts/ctp_only_checks.py); the rCBF data on the pretraining box's /home (about 17 GB; the
# H100 box has its copy already); then a debug pretraining there and a debug training of one arm:
#   condor_submit ctp_only_stage_home.sub -append 'target = rcbf' -append 'gpu_host = REDLRADADM35840'
#   condor_submit ctp_only_bran_pretrain.sub -append 'variant = bran_l1'
#   condor_submit ctp_only_train_h100.sub -append 'target = rcbf' -append 'variant = bran_l1'
# 35840 is the L40S box with a /home/colivares (35839 has none; condor/probe_storage.sub). To use
# another box with one, stage it there and change gpu_host in the three VARS PRE_* lines below.
#
#   cd /raid/colivares/github_repos/MRDPM-with-RAP_fork && git pull
#   condor_q -run          # this account may hold 3 GPUs at once; going over gets jobs booted
#   cd condor && mkdir -p log && condor_submit_dag ctp_only_bran_ext.dag
#   condor_q -dag
#   tail -f ctp_only_bran_ext.dag.dagman.out
#
# HOW MANY AT ONCE: MAXJOBS gpu 3 below counts only this DAG's jobs, and every node holds one GPU.
# Count what else runs (gan_bpm's sweep, other tests) and lower it: `condor_submit_dag -maxjobs N`
# can only lower it. With 3, the GPU part is about 2 days: the pretrainings, three trainings at
# once, then the fourth beside the tests. The priorities run the paper's arm (L1) first.
#
# NO RETRY, as in the folds' DAGs: a retried training would restart from epoch 0 (a restarted job
# resumes on its own; ctp_only_decisions.md #26). If a node fails, DAGMan finishes what doesn't
# depend on it and writes ctp_only_bran_ext.dag.rescue001. Fix the cause, and resume a training by
# hand from its last checkpoint on /radraid2 (ctp_only_train_h100.sub's header, with
# -append 'target = rcbf' -append 'variant = <arm>'), or submit the same DAG again.
#
# A pretraining refuses to start if its BRAN exists on /radraid2 already, and so fails its node:
# after a finished PRE_*, delete that node's lines before a resubmission (or use the rescue file).

JOB      PRE_L1          ctp_only_bran_pretrain.sub
VARS     PRE_L1          variant="bran_l1" fold="0" mode="full" target="rcbf" gpu_host="REDLRADADM35840"
JOB      PRE_EXT         ctp_only_bran_pretrain.sub
VARS     PRE_EXT         variant="bran_ext" fold="0" mode="full" target="rcbf" gpu_host="REDLRADADM35840"
JOB      PRE_LOW         ctp_only_bran_pretrain.sub
VARS     PRE_LOW         variant="bran_extlow" fold="0" mode="full" target="rcbf" gpu_host="REDLRADADM35840"

JOB      CHECK_PRE       ctp_only_core_check.sub
VARS     CHECK_PRE       args="--gan-bpm-only --fold 0 --bran /radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/bran/rcbf_l1 --bran /radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/bran/rcbf_ext --bran /radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/bran/rcbf_extlow"

JOB      TRAIN_L1        ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     TRAIN_L1        variant="bran_l1" fold="0" mode="full" target="rcbf"
JOB      TRAIN_EXT       ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     TRAIN_EXT       variant="bran_ext" fold="0" mode="full" target="rcbf"
JOB      TRAIN_EXT_DIFF  ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     TRAIN_EXT_DIFF  variant="bran_ext_diffext" fold="0" mode="full" target="rcbf"
JOB      TRAIN_L1_DIFF   ctp_only_train_h100.sub
VARS     TRAIN_L1_DIFF   variant="bran_l1_diffext" fold="0" mode="full" target="rcbf"

JOB      TEST_BASE       ctp_only_test_h100.sub
VARS     TEST_BASE       run="/radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/runs/train_ctp_only_f13_rcbf_fold0" testset="cv" mode="full"
JOB      TEST_L1         ctp_only_test_h100.sub
VARS     TEST_L1         run="/radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/runs/train_ctp_only_f13_rcbf_bran_l1_fold0" testset="cv" mode="full"
JOB      TEST_EXT        ctp_only_test_h100.sub
VARS     TEST_EXT        run="/radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/runs/train_ctp_only_f13_rcbf_bran_ext_fold0" testset="cv" mode="full"
JOB      TEST_EXT_DIFF   ctp_only_test_h100.sub
VARS     TEST_EXT_DIFF   run="/radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/runs/train_ctp_only_f13_rcbf_bran_ext_diffext_fold0" testset="cv" mode="full"
JOB      TEST_L1_DIFF    ctp_only_test_h100.sub
VARS     TEST_L1_DIFF    run="/radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/runs/train_ctp_only_f13_rcbf_bran_l1_diffext_fold0" testset="cv" mode="full"

JOB      CHECK_ALL       ctp_only_core_check.sub
VARS     CHECK_ALL       args="--fold 0 --variant bran_l1 --variant bran_ext --variant bran_ext_diffext --variant bran_l1_diffext --bran /radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/bran/rcbf_l1 --bran /radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/bran/rcbf_ext --bran /radraid2/colivares/mrdpm_ctp_only/bran/rcbf_extlow"

PARENT PRE_L1 PRE_EXT PRE_LOW CHILD CHECK_PRE
PARENT PRE_L1  CHILD TRAIN_L1 TRAIN_L1_DIFF
PARENT PRE_EXT CHILD TRAIN_EXT TRAIN_EXT_DIFF
PARENT TRAIN_L1 CHILD TEST_L1
PARENT TRAIN_EXT CHILD TEST_EXT
PARENT TRAIN_EXT_DIFF CHILD TEST_EXT_DIFF
PARENT TRAIN_L1_DIFF CHILD TEST_L1_DIFF
PARENT TEST_L1 TEST_EXT TEST_EXT_DIFF TEST_L1_DIFF PRE_LOW CHILD CHECK_ALL
PARENT TEST_BASE CHILD CHECK_ALL

# The paper's arm first, then the extreme loss in the predictor, then in both, then in L_diff alone;
# the control's test waits for the GPUs the trainings leave.
PRIORITY PRE_L1 50
PRIORITY PRE_EXT 40
PRIORITY PRE_LOW 30
PRIORITY TRAIN_L1 50
PRIORITY TRAIN_EXT 40
PRIORITY TRAIN_EXT_DIFF 30
PRIORITY TRAIN_L1_DIFF 20
PRIORITY TEST_BASE 10

CATEGORY PRE_L1 gpu
CATEGORY PRE_EXT gpu
CATEGORY PRE_LOW gpu
CATEGORY CHECK_PRE gpu
CATEGORY TRAIN_L1 gpu
CATEGORY TRAIN_EXT gpu
CATEGORY TRAIN_EXT_DIFF gpu
CATEGORY TRAIN_L1_DIFF gpu
CATEGORY TEST_BASE gpu
CATEGORY TEST_L1 gpu
CATEGORY TEST_EXT gpu
CATEGORY TEST_EXT_DIFF gpu
CATEGORY TEST_L1_DIFF gpu
CATEGORY CHECK_ALL gpu
MAXJOBS  gpu 3
